                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear Colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your 20-year-old female patient, admitted on 29/01/2021 with confirmed SARS-CoV-2 infection (COVID-19). On admission, she presented with fever, dry cough, dyspnoea, and reduced oxygen saturation. Chest X-ray and CT confirmed bilateral pneumonia. Blood tests revealed elevated inflammatory markers (CRP, ferritin, D-dimer). Arterial blood gas analysis indicated mild hypoxaemia. She was treated with supplemental oxygen therapy, dexamethasone, and anticoagulation. Intravenous fluid replacement was administered during initial days. Pulse oximetry was monitored continuously. Respiratory physiotherapy was initiated, and the patient responded well. By discharge on 11/02/2021, oxygen saturation was stable on room air and clinical condition significantly improved. She is discharged with ongoing recovery. Please ensure follow-up within two weeks and monitor for post-COVID symptoms. Kind regards, Dr. [Treating Physician]</div>
               </text>
